  ],
  "duration_s": 460.758621,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们说到叶启孙最得意的学生熊大枕去了前线，师徒俩，一起造炸药打鬼子。可接下来发生的事儿，我每次想起来心里都堵的慌。一九三九年，熊大枕被人扣上了特务的帽子，含冤而死死的时候才二十六岁。叶启孙听到消息的时候，整个人都懵了，那是他最欣赏的学生啊，跟亲儿子一样，活活生生一个人说没就没了。从那以后，叶启孙就落下了一块心病。他始终不相信自己的学生，是那种人，先后好几次通过正常渠道为熊大诊申诉。可在那个特殊的年代，说真话是要付出代价的。一九六七年，六十九岁的叶启孙受到冲击，被关押停发工资，还被送进了劳改队。一个快七十岁的老人，哪里受得了这个他一度精神恍惚，总听见广播里说他是特务。一九六八年四月，七十岁的叶启孙因为熊大枕的案子受牵连，被正式逮捕，关押在里面。他受过八次连续提审，写过多次笔供，可他从头到尾始终不肯说一句违心的话。一九六九年十一月，因为查无实据，叶启孙被释放回北大。可教授待遇取消了，房子没收了每月只发五十元生活费，还继续被隔离审查。他住进了一间又黑又破的房子，照顾他的工友，也被遣返。从那以后，中关村一带很多人都见过那个穿破棉袄，弓着背的老人在街头徘徊，碰到熟识的学生才低着头轻声说一句，你有钱给我几个所求，不过三五块，最让人心疼的是什么？他故意躲着自己的学生。那时候，他的学生们都在参与国家最重要的科研项目，造原子弹、造导弹发射卫星，个个都是国家的宝贝。叶启孙怕自己的身份连累他们，每次远远看见学生的身影，赶紧低下头，拐进胡同里就走掉了。他宁肯自己苦着，也不愿意给学生添一点麻烦。有一次他的学生钱三强在中关村的马路上碰到了他。钱三强是谁？中国原子弹之父啊。那天，他走在路上，看见一个衣衫褴褛的老人，弓着背在前面慢慢走，走近了一看，浑身唰的一下就凉了，这不是自己的老师。叶启孙吗？前三强赶紧跑上去，拉住老师的手，声音都在发抖。先生，怎么是您呢？您怎么变成这个样子了？叶启孙听到声音猛的抬起头，看清是前三强之后，第一反应不是哭，不是诉苦，而是使劲推开他。压低声音说，你赶快离开我，赶快躲开，以后见到我，别打招呼。说完转身就往胡同深处走，一步都没回头。钱三强站在原地，看着老师佝偻的背影消失在巷子里，眼泪止不住的流。后来他每次跟人提起这件事都泪流满面的说，老师到最后都在保护我们，他是用自己最后的力气在护着我们啊。叶启孙一辈子没结婚，无儿无女，他把所有学生都当成自己的孩子。可到最后，他连一个给自己养老送终的人都没有。一九七二年五月，上面终于宣布对叶启孙按人民内部矛盾处理，恢复了教授待遇和工资。也分配了住房，可他的身体和精神已经被彻底摧垮。一九七七年一月十三日，一个寒冷的冬夜，叶启孙在医院去世，享年七十九岁。一九九二年，王淦昌、王大航、吴建雄等一百二十七位海内外知名学者联名上书，呼吁清华大学为叶启孙建立铜像。联悯者平均年龄高达七十多岁，很多人都是坐着轮椅来签字的。一九九五年，叶启孙的铜像终于在清华大学落成，可没有放在校园最显眼的地方。而是放在了第三教室楼的门厅里。节幕那天，九十岁的王淦昌被人搀着走到铜像前，伸出手抱住那冰冷的铜像，很久很久没有说话，在场许多白发苍苍的老科学家都红了眼眶。叶启孙这一生，没有亲手发射过一颗卫星，没有亲手制造过一颗原子弹，可后来撑起整个中国科技天空的那批人，全都是被他一点一点一个一个托起来的。他在荒漠里播下种子，如今早已是巨树参天。今天这个时代，太多人追名逐利，太多人想当网红赚快钱，可真正撑起一个民族脊梁的，从来都是叶启孙这样的人。他们沉默，他们付出，他们被遗忘。可他们从来没有后悔过。如果有一天，我们连叶启孙这样的名字都觉得陌生了，那才是这个民族真正可怕的事情。记住他叶启孙一个最不该被我们忘记的人说到这儿，想起之前在朋友家翻看到这本书，国之脊梁。叶启孙的故事就在第一篇标题就叫大师的大师。书里不光有叶启孙，还有他的学生王赣昌、赵九章、钱三强、钱学森。就是我前面讲过的那些大科学家，一个不落全在里面，每一位讲出来都看得热泪盈眶。你想想，当年条件那么苦，啥都没有，这些人硬是靠一股劲，把中国的科学搞起来了。现在的孩子天天抱着手机刷短视频，真该让他们好好读读这些人的故事，直到今天的好日子是怎么来的？链接，我放在视频左下角了，感兴趣的朋友们可以去拍回家，细细品读，觉得这段历史值得被更多人知道的。点个赞，点个收藏，评论区告诉我，你看完是什么心情，再转发给身边的亲戚朋友。点个关注我，后面继续给你讲那些被遗忘的大事故事。一个比一个震撼。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 590,
      "end_ms": 4710,
      "text": "咱们说到叶启孙最得意的学生熊大枕去了前线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 5970,
      "text": "师徒俩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 7710,
      "text": "一起造炸药打鬼子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8090,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "可接下来发生的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9850,
      "end_ms": 12530,
      "text": "我每次想起来心里都堵的慌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12570,
      "end_ms": 14070,
      "text": "一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14070,
      "end_ms": 17330,
      "text": "熊大枕被人扣上了特务的帽子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17370,
      "end_ms": 21230,
      "text": "含冤而死死的时候才二十六岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21270,
      "end_ms": 23690,
      "text": "叶启孙听到消息的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23730,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "整个人都懵了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25470,
      "end_ms": 28030,
      "text": "那是他最欣赏的学生啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28070,
      "end_ms": 29750,
      "text": "跟亲儿子一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29750,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "活活生生一个人说没就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "从那以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35040,
      "end_ms": 37480,
      "text": "叶启孙就落下了一块心病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38199,
      "end_ms": 41000,
      "text": "他始终不相信自己的学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41280,
      "end_ms": 42080,
      "text": "是那种人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43040,
      "end_ms": 47100,
      "text": "先后好几次通过正常渠道为熊大诊申诉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47680,
      "end_ms": 49320,
      "text": "可在那个特殊的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49800,
      "end_ms": 51940,
      "text": "说真话是要付出代价的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52860,
      "end_ms": 53980,
      "text": "一九六七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 54820,
      "end_ms": 58120,
      "text": "六十九岁的叶启孙受到冲击，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58960,
      "end_ms": 61800,
      "text": "被关押停发工资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62040,
      "end_ms": 63675,
      "text": "还被送进了劳改队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64510,
      "end_ms": 66545,
      "text": "一个快七十岁的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66960,
      "end_ms": 71445,
      "text": "哪里受得了这个他一度精神恍惚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72340,
      "end_ms": 74825,
      "text": "总听见广播里说他是特务。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76900,
      "end_ms": 78360,
      "text": "一九六八年四月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78380,
      "end_ms": 82015,
      "text": "七十岁的叶启孙因为熊大枕的案子受牵连，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82340,
      "end_ms": 83480,
      "text": "被正式逮捕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83540,
      "end_ms": 85515,
      "text": "关押在里面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85810,
      "end_ms": 87945,
      "text": "他受过八次连续提审，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 88270,
      "end_ms": 89685,
      "text": "写过多次笔供，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90520,
      "end_ms": 94715,
      "text": "可他从头到尾始终不肯说一句违心的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95150,
      "end_ms": 96865,
      "text": "一九六九年十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97220,
      "end_ms": 98515,
      "text": "因为查无实据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98850,
      "end_ms": 100955,
      "text": "叶启孙被释放回北大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101770,
      "end_ms": 103375,
      "text": "可教授待遇取消了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 103720,
      "end_ms": 106975,
      "text": "房子没收了每月只发五十元生活费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 107360,
      "end_ms": 109305,
      "text": "还继续被隔离审查。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 109800,
      "end_ms": 113015,
      "text": "他住进了一间又黑又破的房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113880,
      "end_ms": 115000,
      "text": "照顾他的工友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 115180,
      "end_ms": 116180,
      "text": "也被遣返。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116340,
      "end_ms": 117265,
      "text": "从那以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 117610,
      "end_ms": 121445,
      "text": "中关村一带很多人都见过那个穿破棉袄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 121730,
      "end_ms": 124545,
      "text": "弓着背的老人在街头徘徊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125260,
      "end_ms": 129415,
      "text": "碰到熟识的学生才低着头轻声说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130050,
      "end_ms": 132960,
      "text": "你有钱给我几个所求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 132960,
      "end_ms": 134025,
      "text": "不过三五块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 135020,
      "end_ms": 136925,
      "text": "最让人心疼的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 137180,
      "end_ms": 139005,
      "text": "他故意躲着自己的学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139880,
      "end_ms": 140380,
      "text": "那时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 140380,
      "end_ms": 144305,
      "text": "他的学生们都在参与国家最重要的科研项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 144870,
      "end_ms": 148895,
      "text": "造原子弹、造导弹发射卫星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 149370,
      "end_ms": 151185,
      "text": "个个都是国家的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 151760,
      "end_ms": 154300,
      "text": "叶启孙怕自己的身份连累他们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 154340,
      "end_ms": 156685,
      "text": "每次远远看见学生的身影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 157150,
      "end_ms": 158165,
      "text": "赶紧低下头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 158680,
      "end_ms": 160185,
      "text": "拐进胡同里就走掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 160850,
      "end_ms": 162405,
      "text": "他宁肯自己苦着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 162810,
      "end_ms": 164925,
      "text": "也不愿意给学生添一点麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 167480,
      "end_ms": 171845,
      "text": "有一次他的学生钱三强在中关村的马路上碰到了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 172650,
      "end_ms": 173735,
      "text": "钱三强是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174110,
      "end_ms": 175545,
      "text": "中国原子弹之父啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 175920,
      "end_ms": 176220,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 176220,
      "end_ms": 177105,
      "text": "他走在路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 177800,
      "end_ms": 180200,
      "text": "看见一个衣衫褴褛的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 180260,
      "end_ms": 182035,
      "text": "弓着背在前面慢慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 182540,
      "end_ms": 183575,
      "text": "走近了一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 183870,
      "end_ms": 185525,
      "text": "浑身唰的一下就凉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 186430,
      "end_ms": 187750,
      "text": "这不是自己的老师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 187750,
      "end_ms": 188670,
      "text": "叶启孙吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 188770,
      "end_ms": 190715,
      "text": "前三强赶紧跑上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 191070,
      "end_ms": 192165,
      "text": "拉住老师的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 192500,
      "end_ms": 193585,
      "text": "声音都在发抖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 194070,
      "end_ms": 194635,
      "text": "先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 195000,
      "end_ms": 195985,
      "text": "怎么是您呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 196340,
      "end_ms": 198065,
      "text": "您怎么变成这个样子了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 198710,
      "end_ms": 201495,
      "text": "叶启孙听到声音猛的抬起头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 202030,
      "end_ms": 203675,
      "text": "看清是前三强之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 204030,
      "end_ms": 205660,
      "text": "第一反应不是哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 205860,
      "end_ms": 206635,
      "text": "不是诉苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206990,
      "end_ms": 208625,
      "text": "而是使劲推开他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 209030,
      "end_ms": 209995,
      "text": "压低声音说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 210560,
      "end_ms": 211720,
      "text": "你赶快离开我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 211940,
      "end_ms": 212895,
      "text": "赶快躲开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 213250,
      "end_ms": 214395,
      "text": "以后见到我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 214850,
      "end_ms": 215695,
      "text": "别打招呼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 216010,
      "end_ms": 218780,
      "text": "说完转身就往胡同深处走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 219000,
      "end_ms": 220135,
      "text": "一步都没回头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 221060,
      "end_ms": 222420,
      "text": "钱三强站在原地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 222500,
      "end_ms": 225765,
      "text": "看着老师佝偻的背影消失在巷子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 226030,
      "end_ms": 227625,
      "text": "眼泪止不住的流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 228210,
      "end_ms": 232515,
      "text": "后来他每次跟人提起这件事都泪流满面的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 232960,
      "end_ms": 234805,
      "text": "老师到最后都在保护我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 235390,
      "end_ms": 238265,
      "text": "他是用自己最后的力气在护着我们啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 239270,
      "end_ms": 241015,
      "text": "叶启孙一辈子没结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 241290,
      "end_ms": 242025,
      "text": "无儿无女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 242960,
      "end_ms": 245875,
      "text": "他把所有学生都当成自己的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 246650,
      "end_ms": 247605,
      "text": "可到最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 248180,
      "end_ms": 251425,
      "text": "他连一个给自己养老送终的人都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 251870,
      "end_ms": 253355,
      "text": "一九七二年五月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 253810,
      "end_ms": 258800,
      "text": "上面终于宣布对叶启孙按人民内部矛盾处理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 258820,
      "end_ms": 261005,
      "text": "恢复了教授待遇和工资。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 261500,
      "end_ms": 262965,
      "text": "也分配了住房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 263630,
      "end_ms": 267525,
      "text": "可他的身体和精神已经被彻底摧垮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 268540,
      "end_ms": 270715,
      "text": "一九七七年一月十三日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 271110,
      "end_ms": 272745,
      "text": "一个寒冷的冬夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 273450,
      "end_ms": 275130,
      "text": "叶启孙在医院去世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 275450,
      "end_ms": 276905,
      "text": "享年七十九岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 277840,
      "end_ms": 278820,
      "text": "一九九二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 279020,
      "end_ms": 286220,
      "text": "王淦昌、王大航、吴建雄等一百二十七位海内外知名学者联名上书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 286600,
      "end_ms": 290125,
      "text": "呼吁清华大学为叶启孙建立铜像。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 290760,
      "end_ms": 294000,
      "text": "联悯者平均年龄高达七十多岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 294440,
      "end_ms": 297495,
      "text": "很多人都是坐着轮椅来签字的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 298740,
      "end_ms": 299720,
      "text": "一九九五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 299920,
      "end_ms": 303100,
      "text": "叶启孙的铜像终于在清华大学落成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 303600,
      "end_ms": 306735,
      "text": "可没有放在校园最显眼的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 307270,
      "end_ms": 310370,
      "text": "而是放在了第三教室楼的门厅里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 310990,
      "end_ms": 311870,
      "text": "节幕那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 312130,
      "end_ms": 316230,
      "text": "九十岁的王淦昌被人搀着走到铜像前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 316890,
      "end_ms": 319350,
      "text": "伸出手抱住那冰冷的铜像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 320110,
      "end_ms": 321690,
      "text": "很久很久没有说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 322590,
      "end_ms": 326950,
      "text": "在场许多白发苍苍的老科学家都红了眼眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 328010,
      "end_ms": 329350,
      "text": "叶启孙这一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 330070,
      "end_ms": 332870,
      "text": "没有亲手发射过一颗卫星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 333230,
      "end_ms": 335930,
      "text": "没有亲手制造过一颗原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 336410,
      "end_ms": 339900,
      "text": "可后来撑起整个中国科技天空的那批人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 340020,
      "end_ms": 344280,
      "text": "全都是被他一点一点一个一个托起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 344960,
      "end_ms": 346780,
      "text": "他在荒漠里播下种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 347140,
      "end_ms": 349420,
      "text": "如今早已是巨树参天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 350160,
      "end_ms": 351280,
      "text": "今天这个时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 351520,
      "end_ms": 353299,
      "text": "太多人追名逐利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353780,
      "end_ms": 356060,
      "text": "太多人想当网红赚快钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 356280,
      "end_ms": 358880,
      "text": "可真正撑起一个民族脊梁的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 359160,
      "end_ms": 361560,
      "text": "从来都是叶启孙这样的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 361920,
      "end_ms": 362880,
      "text": "他们沉默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 363160,
      "end_ms": 364140,
      "text": "他们付出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 364400,
      "end_ms": 365460,
      "text": "他们被遗忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00141",
      "start_ms": 365640,
      "end_ms": 367745,
      "text": "可他们从来没有后悔过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00142",
      "start_ms": 368210,
      "end_ms": 369010,
      "text": "如果有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00143",
      "start_ms": 369310,
      "end_ms": 373055,
      "text": "我们连叶启孙这样的名字都觉得陌生了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00144",
      "start_ms": 373630,
      "end_ms": 376550,
      "text": "那才是这个民族真正可怕的事情。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00145",
      "start_ms": 376650,
      "end_ms": 382615,
      "text": "记住他叶启孙一个最不该被我们忘记的人说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00146",
      "start_ms": 382910,
      "end_ms": 385485,
      "text": "想起之前在朋友家翻看到这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00147",
      "start_ms": 386140,
      "end_ms": 387075,
      "text": "国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00148",
      "start_ms": 387710,
      "end_ms": 393365,
      "text": "叶启孙的故事就在第一篇标题就叫大师的大师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00149",
      "start_ms": 394320,
      "end_ms": 396060,
      "text": "书里不光有叶启孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00150",
      "start_ms": 396440,
      "end_ms": 401325,
      "text": "还有他的学生王赣昌、赵九章、钱三强、钱学森。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00151",
      "start_ms": 402030,
      "end_ms": 404385,
      "text": "就是我前面讲过的那些大科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00152",
      "start_ms": 404990,
      "end_ms": 408185,
      "text": "一个不落全在里面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00153",
      "start_ms": 409100,
      "end_ms": 413420,
      "text": "每一位讲出来都看得热泪盈眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00154",
      "start_ms": 413620,
      "end_ms": 414355,
      "text": "你想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00155",
      "start_ms": 414650,
      "end_ms": 415930,
      "text": "当年条件那么苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00156",
      "start_ms": 416090,
      "end_ms": 417075,
      "text": "啥都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00157",
      "start_ms": 417560,
      "end_ms": 419260,
      "text": "这些人硬是靠一股劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00158",
      "start_ms": 419440,
      "end_ms": 421435,
      "text": "把中国的科学搞起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00159",
      "start_ms": 422110,
      "end_ms": 425695,
      "text": "现在的孩子天天抱着手机刷短视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00160",
      "start_ms": 426310,
      "end_ms": 429555,
      "text": "真该让他们好好读读这些人的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00161",
      "start_ms": 430080,
      "end_ms": 433055,
      "text": "直到今天的好日子是怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00162",
      "start_ms": 433760,
      "end_ms": 434240,
      "text": "链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00163",
      "start_ms": 434360,
      "end_ms": 436065,
      "text": "我放在视频左下角了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00164",
      "start_ms": 436480,
      "end_ms": 438845,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友们可以去拍回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00165",
      "start_ms": 439300,
      "end_ms": 440395,
      "text": "细细品读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00166",
      "start_ms": 441380,
      "end_ms": 444595,
      "text": "觉得这段历史值得被更多人知道的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00167",
      "start_ms": 445360,
      "end_ms": 446045,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00168",
      "start_ms": 446850,
      "end_ms": 447795,
      "text": "点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00169",
      "start_ms": 448760,
      "end_ms": 449900,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00170",
      "start_ms": 449920,
      "end_ms": 451260,
      "text": "你看完是什么心情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00171",
      "start_ms": 451460,
      "end_ms": 453680,
      "text": "再转发给身边的亲戚朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00172",
      "start_ms": 453920,
      "end_ms": 455530,
      "text": "点个关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00173",
      "start_ms": 455530,
      "end_ms": 459045,
      "text": "后面继续给你讲那些被遗忘的大事故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c4e5ed7f3e99330b_s00174",
      "start_ms": 459430,
      "end_ms": 460575,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    }
  ],
